+- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5357+) New **Movies category** (bik, nif, dds) for **Victories**, **Wonders**, **Projects**, **Religions**, and **Eras**, additional **audio support for non-bik** files (e.g. Religions have a nif + separate audio asset). **Play button** added in related Sevopedia categories to redirect to their entry in Sevopedia Movies. Movies are played on a **new screen**. Click on "OK" or Right-click to **stop the media playing**; press Escape or Enter key for main menu. See [Sevopedia reworks (Movies (with audio support))](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-090-movies-category-with-audio-support).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5359+) New **Music category**: allows to play **~1750 audio scripts** (i.e. files) in Sevopedia, notably for **Techs**, **Leaders**, **Eras**, **Civilizations**, and many other. **Play button** added in related Sevopedia categories to redirect to Sevopedia Music. Approach broadly similar to that of Sevopedia Movies. **Search bar support** and **widening** allows to find desired tracks. See [Sevopedia reworks (Music)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-091-music-category-1750-audio-scripts-playable-in-sevopedia).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5340+) Added a new **Sevopedia Builds** category (e.g. **"Remove Jungle"**, **Chop Down a Forest**, **"Build a Road"**, **"Create a Farm"**) distinct from Sevopedia Improvements, notably with **FeatureStruct** panels and **mod-agnostic new Civilopedia blurbs-based Background panel** (added the new XML field `Civilopedia`> to BuildInfos). Also added them to **Sevopedia Index** as **clickable entries with buttons**. See [Sevopedia reworks (Builds)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-040-builds-category-eg-remove-jungle-build-road-create-a-farm).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5354+) Sevopedia — Improvements: Added a new sortable **Improvement Weights (Leaders) Chart**, showing **Weights**, **Count** per Weight, and **clickable Leader buttons** for each weight and improvement.

